    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\">In a tree, <const>@</const> forms the crown and <const>#</const> forms the trunk. Ignore all other characters.<br><br><strong>Guaranteed:</strong> tree rows are consecutive, centered, solid blocks of <const>@</const> or <const>#</const>. Crown rows have odd widths and precede any trunk rows.<br><br>A valid tree has crown rows of widths <const>1</const>, <const>3</const>, <const>5</const>, ... and trunk rows of width <const>1</const>, with at least one row of each. The crown may stop early.<br><br>If valid, print all tree row widths from top to bottom, separated by spaces. Otherwise, print <const>INVALID</const>.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\">Line 1: Two integers <var>h</var> and <var>w</var>, the picture's height and odd width.<br>Next <var>h</var> lines: A string <var>row</var> of exactly <var>w</var> characters.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\">One line: The crown and trunk row widths, separated by spaces, or <const>INVALID</const>.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\">1 &lt;= <var>h</var>, <var>w</var> &lt;= 31<br><var>w</var> is odd.<br>Each <var>row</var> contains exactly <var>w</var> printable ASCII characters, possibly including spaces.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-in\">13 21\n*..........*.........\n....*..........*.....\n........*..........*.\n..........@..........\n.........@@@.........\n........@@@@@........\n.......@@@@@@@.......\n......@@@@@@@@@......\n..........#..........\n..........#..........\n/\\|v_/\\|v_/\\|v_/\\|v_/\n\\|v_/\\|v_/\\|v_/\\|v_/\\\n|v_/\\|v_/\\|v_/\\|v_/\\|</pre>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-out\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-out\">1 3 5 7 9 1 1</pre>\n         </div>\n      </div>\n   </div>\n</div>"
